  Slug: rock-dwarf
  DisplayName: Rock Dwarf
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/ancestry/rock-dwarf.webp
  Description: Your ancestors lived and worked among the ancient stones of the mountains
    or the depths of the earth. This makes you solid as a rock when you plant your
    feet. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your Fortitude or Reflex DC against
    attempts to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Reposition], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Shove],
    or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Trip] you. This bonus also applies
    to saving throws against spells or effects that attempt to force you to move
    or knock you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone]. In addition, if
    any effect would force you to move 10 feet or more, you are moved only half the
    distance.
